    <h2>🌸 What is Raksha Bandhan?</h2>
    <p>
      Raksha Bandhan is a traditional Indian festival that celebrates
      the loving relationship between brothers and sisters. On this
      special day, sisters tie a rakhi around their brothers' wrists
      and brothers promise to support and protect their sisters.
    </p>

    <p>
      Families come together to exchange gifts, enjoy sweets,
      share memories and celebrate their unique bond.
    </p>
  </div>

